# Per-test plusargs for irq_during_movem.
#
# This test exercises audit bug #1 (IRQ at sub-µop boundary inside a
# MOVEM crack).  Without IPL injection the test passes by-construction
# (the MOVEM completes without IRQ ever firing).  With +ipl= the test
# actually exercises the bug — the rob_is_last_uop gate on take_irq
# (added in this commit) defers the IRQ to the post-MOVEM boundary so
# no µop gets squashed mid-crack.
#
# Inject IPL=1 at cycle 200 — well inside MOVEM's store µop sequence
# but before the finalize µop retires.  With the fix landed the IRQ
# is held off until MOVEM completes.
+ipl=200:1
